{"id":"be2c","jah":"76203f8daae6a146f220a7ba083271b2","en":"Now we have a Supporters' Club, its\nannual running costs will be set\nat the start of each year.","max_bytes":79,"refs":2,"ctx":"ptr@10e0 xrefs=2"}
{"id":"be7b","jah":"5fd1dda454bfa359c3131b8ad10eda62","en":"Running costs pay for newsletters,\nevents, merchandise and more for\nSupporters' Club members.","max_bytes":97,"refs":2,"ctx":"ptr@eb4 xrefs=2"}
{"id":"bedc","jah":"420be0f05ad9764fb55dd4ea4094bd15","en":"The higher the running costs, the\nmore members we can serve well.","max_bytes":74,"refs":2,"ctx":"ptr@ebc xrefs=2"}
{"id":"bf26","jah":"8e8dcbbeececaa1aff311e814e5066ba","en":"Set costs for all 12 months, January\nto December. One month's share is\ndeducted at each month end. Take note.","max_bytes":97,"refs":2,"ctx":"ptr@fe4 xrefs=2"}
{"id":"bf87","jah":"ecdb0adb7b83b74f95551c578acf8cce","en":"Please set this year's annual running\ncosts. @Y/%m@ is suitable.\nOne twelfth is deducted every month.","max_bytes":99,"refs":3,"ctx":"ptr@ff0 xrefs=3"}
{"id":"bfea","jah":"ad907f7e4025783811db2a2b8be511f2","en":"I think we'll run short of funds...\nThat amount is a bit much, I'm afraid.\nPlease enter it again.","max_bytes":101,"refs":2,"ctx":"tbl@328[0/3] xrefs=2"}
{"id":"c04f","jah":"eafff6251e17e168b4e0b8f8ebf4477d","en":"That's far too low, surely.\nIf funds are tight it can't be helped,\nbut are you sure about this?","max_bytes":109,"refs":2,"ctx":"tbl@328[1/3] xrefs=2"}
